## Change

The public Java method is equals(Object). Rust java_equals previously accepted only Option<&MessageQueueAssignment>, so the invoked Java fixture's unrelated-object input was absent from the Rust comparison. The method now accepts Option<&dyn Any>, returns false for an unrelated concrete type before dereferencing messageQueue, and preserves the same-instance and null-queue branches. The Protocol fixture test directly compares the wrong-type result with assignmentMethodCases.equalsWrongType.

